b9 is a text with value "Arithmetic", size 26, weight 800, foreground "#0b1d36", letterspacing "-0.02em", margin "14px 0 0 0"
b10 is a text with value "Calculations use everyday words. make stores the result:", size 16, foreground "#3a4d6b", lineheight "1.6"
b11 is a text with value "number1 is 10\nnumber2 is 5\n\nnumber1 and number2 make total\nnumber1 minus number2 make difference\nnumber1 times number2 make product\nnumber1 divided by number2 make quotient\n\nsay \"Total:\" total\nsay \"Difference:\" difference\nsay \"Product:\" product\nsay \"Quotient:\" quotient", size 14, foreground "#e5edf8", background "#0f1b2e", radius 12, fontfamily "'JetBrains Mono', Consolas, monospace", whitespace "pre", customstyle "padding: 18px 22px; line-height: 1.7; overflow-x: auto; border-top-left-radius: 0; border-top-right-radius: 0;", runnable true
b11label is a text with value "Otter", size 12, weight 600, foreground "#b7c4d8"
b11copy is a button with text "Copy", size 12, weight 600, background "#22375a", foreground "#e5edf8", radius 6, padding "4px 12px"
b11head is a row with spread, align middle, width full, background "#16263f", padding "8px 14px", customstyle "box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 12px 12px 0 0;"
put b11label, b11copy in b11head
b11block is a column with spacing 0, width full
put b11head, b11 in b11block
when b11copy is clicked
    copy text of b11 to clipboard
    text of b11copy is "Copied"
.
b12 is a text with value "Total: 15\nDifference: 5\nProduct: 50\nQuotient: 2", size 14, foreground "#0f1f36", background "#e8eef7", radius 12, fontfamily "'JetBrains Mono', Consolas, monospace", whitespace "pre", customstyle "padding: 16px 22px; line-height: 1.7; overflow-x: auto; border-top-left-radius: 0; border-top-right-radius: 0;"
b12label is a text with value "Output", size 12, weight 600, foreground "#4a5b75"
