b13 is a text with value "Dividing by zero is a readable Otter error, never a crash.", size 16, foreground "#3a4d6b", lineheight "1.6"
b14 is a text with value "Changing a number in place", size 26, weight 800, foreground "#0b1d36", letterspacing "-0.02em", margin "14px 0 0 0"
