b17 is a text with value "Input", size 26, weight 800, foreground "#0b1d36", letterspacing "-0.02em", margin "14px 0 0 0"
b18 is a text with value "ask converts what was typed: 42 becomes the number 42, true becomes a boolean, and everything else stays text.", size 16, foreground "#3a4d6b", lineheight "1.6"
b19 is a text with value "ask \"Enter your age: \" and call it age\nage and 5 make futureAge\nsay \"In 5 years you will be:\" futureAge", size 14, foreground "#e5edf8", background "#0f1b2e", radius 12, fontfamily "'JetBrains Mono', Consolas, monospace", whitespace "pre", customstyle "padding: 18px 22px; line-height: 1.7; overflow-x: auto; border-top-left-radius: 0; border-top-right-radius: 0;", runnable true
